WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.293
Today your child learns to read two or three words together.

2
00:00:03.743 --> 00:00:06.322
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.822 --> 00:00:09.846
Word by word sounds like this. The, big, dog.

4
00:00:10.296 --> 00:00:12.701
One scoop sounds like this. The big dog.

5
00:00:13.401 --> 00:00:19.180
On the page, each scoop has a curved line under it. Slide your finger along the line as you read.

6
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:24.035
You read the scoop first. Then your child slides a finger, and says it after you.

7
00:00:24.485 --> 00:00:27.900
Do all four this way. A red hen, on the bus, in the mud.

8
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:33.788
Then read the sentence at the bottom together. It is two scoops. The big dog, ran in the mud.

9
00:00:34.238 --> 00:00:40.951
For job two, your child reads each scoop alone, and draws a line to its picture. The picture is the check.

10
00:00:41.401 --> 00:00:43.885
At the end, your child reads three scoops to you.
